  m_Name: SSO_Log_Torch
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Header: 'Custodian''s Handbook: PF-Torches'
  Body: 'The PF-Torch is equipped with a rune that calculates its vertical distance
    from the Portable Fabricator. The color emitted from the crystal is then updated
    to reflect said distance.

    

    DO NOT try to retrieve the PF-Torch if
    the crystal''s light fades out.'
  IsDiscovered: 0
